    "statement_raw_token": "\"Let $\\\\mathfrak D$ be a hereditary class of indecomposable ordered binary structures. Suppose that $\\\\mathfrak D$ is hereditary well-quasi-ordered and hereditary algebraic. **Sum-closure conjecture.** The sum-closure of $\\\\mathfrak D$ is hereditary algebraic. This conjecture would imply that the sum-closure of the class of critical bichains is hereditary algebraic; the latter is known to be well-quasi-ordered and algebraic, but its hereditary algebraicity remains open.\"",
